WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.378 --> 00:00:03.205
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.205 --> 00:00:06.155
新建断点规则 / Create the breakpoint Rule

3
00:00:06.155 --> 00:00:09.008
填写 Guide request breakpoint / Name the Rule

4
00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.860
设置本机测试 Host / Set the local test Host

5
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.060
添加 Path 条件 / Add a Path condition

6
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.869
限制 /guide/breakpoints / Restrict the breakpoint path

7
00:00:17.869 --> 00:00:20.665
移除默认 Header 动作 / Remove the default Header action

8
00:00:20.665 --> 00:00:23.963
添加 Breakpoint 动作 / Add a Breakpoint action

9
00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:26.813
启用断点规则 / Enable the Rule

10
00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:29.663
Apply 生效 / Apply the Rule

11
00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:32.513
回到 Capture / Return to Capture

12
00:00:32.513 --> 00:00:35.713
发出并选中挂起请求 / Send and select the paused request

13
00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:38.661
选择 Text 替换 / Choose Text replacement

14
00:00:38.661 --> 00:00:41.514
输入 edited-by-guide / Enter the replacement body

15
00:00:41.514 --> 00:00:44.461
Forward edited 并核对源站 / Forward edited and verify the origin

16
00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:47.461
发出下一条请求 / Send the next request

17
00:00:47.461 --> 00:00:50.420
原样放行 / Continue unmodified

18
00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:53.462
选中要丢弃的测试请求 / Select a disposable request

19
00:00:53.462 --> 00:00:56.413
Drop 并核对客户端错误 / Drop and inspect the client error

20
00:00:56.413 --> 00:00:59.412
停用测试规则 / Disable the test Rule

21
00:00:59.412 --> 00:01:02.264
保存停用 / Apply the disabled state
